WEBVTT

00:06:29.368 --> 00:06:31.948
It's what religious tribes do.

00:06:31.972 --> 00:06:35.358
They believe an enemy is necessary
for the tribe to survive,

00:06:35.382 --> 00:06:37.406
so where no enemy exists,

00:06:37.430 --> 00:06:39.221
they create one.

00:06:39.245 --> 00:06:41.522
Right now, sexual minorities
are the enemy;

00:06:41.546 --> 00:06:44.015
my departure was swift and sure.

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:49.326
I was surprised when my son
left his job teaching in West Philadelphia

00:06:49.350 --> 00:06:51.028
to go into the ministry.

00:06:51.052 --> 00:06:53.153
I did not see that one coming.

00:06:54.145 --> 00:06:55.626
And now I wondered:

00:06:56.226 --> 00:06:57.531
What would he do?

00:06:58.172 --> 00:07:00.995
I didn't have to wait that long
to find an answer.